## 📱 Final Notes
This InfinityX v4.0 Android 17 release for the OnePlus Nord 5 focuses on device-specific fixes and improvements.

The main highlights are improved proximity sensor behavior during calls, corrected screen-off behavior when listening to WhatsApp and Telegram voice messages, improved Lift to Check Phone functionality, and stronger, more consistent LiveTap vibration feedback.

The release also includes KernelSU Next v3.3.0 support and SUSFS integration, together with device configuration updates and changes intended to improve thermal behavior and sustained performance.
